WEBVTT

00:00:59.855 --> 00:01:02.283
and she was always on my team.

00:01:03.895 --> 00:01:05.101
When she said it,

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:07.418
she was actually making a point
about my lecture,

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:11.696
by quoting a line from a 1970s
movie, a comedy,

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.453
that had two racist slurs.

00:01:14.016 --> 00:01:16.405
One for people of Chinese descent

00:01:16.429 --> 00:01:18.162
and the other the N-word.

00:01:19.143 --> 00:01:23.135
As soon as she said it,
I held up my hands, said, "Whoa, whoa."

00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:24.410
But she assured me,

00:01:24.434 --> 00:01:27.156
"It's a joke from 'Blazing Saddles,'"

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:28.847
and then she repeated it.